      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This “Prayer for Home” can be found in the <tei:hi rend="italic">Abridged Prayer Book for the Jews in the Armed Forces of the United States</tei:hi> (Jewish Welfare Board 1941), p. 119.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>As far as we know, this prayer is unique to this prayerbook. The author of the prayer is also not known; three well-known rabbis contributed to the siddur: David de Sola Pool, Eugene Kohn, and Solomon B. Freehof. It would be good to know if similar prayers appeared in the religious resources for chaplains of other religious traditions. If you know more details concerning its authorship or whether it was published elsewhere, please leave a comment or contact us. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
